{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1311c68f-2e99-8a94-bb37-3bedb4bb7224",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T12:12:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luz Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:10:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Luz Cordero. I am calling about a catch basin near my home, and I would kindly like to know who ought to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:10:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Ms. Cordero. Where is the catch basin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:10:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I live at 194 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. The drain is on the corner, just down from my house. It has been clogged with leaves since Monday, and the water simply sits there in a puddle. It never goes down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:10:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday, okay. And it hasn't rained, has it? So this is just standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there has been no storm at all. It is dry weather. That is what I find so... [pause] Excuse me one moment. My freezer door is beeping, I am putting away the groceries. I have just come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, take your time. I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. There. I had left it ajar with the peas. Now, as I was saying, the leaves are packed right over the grate, and the puddle reaches nearly into the road. I have taken photographs of it. I would be glad to send them, if you tell me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. I can take down an email for you to send them to, or if you'd rather, I can note that photos are available and the crew can contact you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer that they contact me. My number is 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me read that back. 401-555-0193. And the location is the corner catch basin near 194 Chapel Street, clogged with leaves since Monday, standing water, no rain involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is exactly right. And who is it that goes out to clear it? I should like to know whom to call if it is not done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be a Public Works crew, the ones who handle the catch basins. I'll put in the request now, and if nothing's happened in a few days you can call this office back and ask about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do that. I do wish it had been seen sooner, since it has been sitting there for days, but I appreciate your writing it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. It's in the system now with your number and the note about the photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you kindly. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Cordero. Bye now."
    }
  ],
